### **Problem: "Electron App startet nicht"**

**Test-Workflow:**

1. **Build-Status prüfen:**
   ```bash
   dir apps\frontend\dist\win-unpacked\Auto-Claude.exe
   ```

2. **Dependencies prüfen:**
   ```bash
   cd apps\frontend
